    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d637">

                <pb facs="0550" n="434" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg434"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 895.102/11.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Blanchard to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 29.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to previous correspondence
                    reporting upon the conference between the consular representatives of the treaty
                    powers at Seoul and the representative of the Government General with regard to
                    the conditions of the proposed transfer to the Government General <pb
                        facs="0551" n="435" xml:id="pg435"/> of the Affairs of Foreign Settlements
                    in Chosen, I now have the honor to inclose herewith a copy of Consul General
                    Scidmore’s No. 4350 to this Embassy, dated April 22,<anchor n="7"
                        xml:id="d637-f1"/> transmitting transcripts of the seventh and eighth
                    meetings held at Seoul March 31 and April 14, and the original of the final
                    protocol signed by all the representatives concerned.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Bailly-Blanchard</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d637-a1.xml" xpointer="d637-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
